d":0,"detail":"產品定價權增強，毛利結構健康"},{"id":9,"category":"營運效率","desc":"資產週轉率提升 (ΔTurnover > 0)","passed":1,"detail":"每單位資產產出效益改善"}],"fair_val":7.33,"default_fair_val":7.33,"premium_pct":1686.6,"is_undervalued":false,"pe_trailing":172.3,"pe_forward":151.6,"pb_trailing":28.3,"pb_forward":25.5,"div_yield":0,"ps_ratio":85.1,"fcf_to_ev":7.73,"fcf_to_mcap":0.29,"liab_to_assets":70.5,"cash_to_assets":19.3,"current_ratio":1.44,"roe":16.4,"roa":4.9,"moat":{"ticker":"P","period":"2027Q2","m1_brand_pricing":{"score":7,"comment_zh":"Everpure 品牌在高端濾水市場享有盛譽，其產品被視為高品質和可靠性的象徵，尤其在餐飲業和醫療保健領域。這種品牌忠誠度賦予了公司一定的定價權，使其能夠維持高於平均水平的利潤率。然而，市場上仍存在其他品牌和替代方案，且消費者對價格的敏感度並非完全不考慮，因此定價權並非絕對。","comment_en":"Everpure commands strong brand recognition in the premium water filtration market, associated with quality and reliability, particularly in food service and healthcare. This brand loyalty allows for some pricing power, enabling above-average margins. However, the presence of competing brands and alternatives, along with some consumer price sensitivity, prevents this from being an absolute pricing moat."},"m2_patents_regulatory":{"score":6,"comment_zh":"Everpure 的專利技術，特別是在水處理和過濾方面，為其產品提供了技術壁壘。這些專利限制了競爭對手模仿其核心技術的能力。此外，在某些特定應用領域，如醫療和食品安全，產品需要符合嚴格的監管標準，這也形成了一定的進入門檻。然而，專利有時效性，且技術迭代迅速，監管標準也可能變化。","comment_en":"Everpure's patented technologies in water treatment and filtration create a technical barrier, limiting competitors' ability to replicate its core innovations. Regulatory standards in specific sectors like healthcare and food safety also impose entry barriers. However, patents have expiration dates, and rapid technological evolution and changing regulations can diminish this moat over time."},"m3_high_switching_costs":{"score":5,"comment_zh":"對於餐飲和醫療等行業的企業客戶而言，更換濾水系統可能涉及設備重置、重新驗證流程以及潛在的服務中斷，這構成了一定的轉換成本。然而，對於家庭用戶，更換成本相對較低，主要體現在購買新產品的費用。因此，轉換成本的壁壘在中高端市場較為顯著，但在大眾市場則較弱。","comment_en":"For enterprise clients in sectors like food service and healthcare, switching water filtration systems can involve equipment replacement, re-validation of processes, and potential service disruptions, creating moderate switching costs. For residential users, however, the cost of switching is lower, primarily the expense of a new product. Thus, the switching cost moat is more pronounced in the high-end market than in the mass market."},"m4_network_effects":{"score":1,"comment_zh":"Everpure 的業務模式不具備顯著的網絡效應。其產品的價值和市場地位主要依賴於產品本身的性能、品牌聲譽和分銷網絡，而非用戶之間的互動或連接。因此，網絡效應幾乎不存在，無法構成其主要的經濟護城河。","comment_en":"Everpure's business model does not exhibit significant network effects. The value and market position of its products are primarily driven by product performance, brand reputation, and distribution networks, rather than user interactions or connections. Consequently, network effects are virtually non-existent and do not form a primary economic moat."},"m5_cost_advantage_scale":{"score":6,"comment_zh":"作為一家在水過濾行業擁有長期經驗和較大生產規模的公司，Everpure 可能從規模經濟中獲得一定的成本優勢，尤其是在採購原材料和優化生產流程方面。這有助於其在價格上與小型競爭對手競爭。然而，與大型多元化製造商相比，其規模優勢可能不夠突出，且技術密集型生產的成本結構也限制了規模效應的極大化。","comment_en":"As a company with extensive experience and significant production scale in the water filtration industry, Everpure may benefit from economies of scale, particularly in raw material procurement and production process optimization. This aids in competing on price against smaller rivals. However, its scale advantage might not be as pronounced compared to larger, diversified manufacturers, and the cost structure of its technology-intensive production limits the maximization of scale effects."},"m6_unique_geography_assets":{"score":2,"comment_zh":"Everpure 的業務主要依賴於其產品技術和品牌，而非特定的地理位置或獨特的物理資產。雖然其分銷網絡遍布全球，但這更多是市場滲透的結果，而非構成獨特的地理壁壘。公司並未依賴於某個特定地區的資源或市場，因此這方面護城河較弱。","comment_en":"Everpure's business relies primarily on its product technology and brand, rather than specific geographic locations or unique physical assets. While its distribution network is global, this reflects market penetration rather than a unique geographical barrier. The company does not depend on resources or markets in a particular region, making this moat component weak."},"m7_operational_efficiency":{"score":7,"comment_zh":"Everpure 在其營運效率方面表現出色，體現在其穩定的營收增長和盈利能力上。公司能夠有效地管理生產、供應鏈和銷售渠道，以滿足市場需求。其較高的 ROE 和 ROA 指標也側面印證了其營運效率。持續的流程優化和成本控制是其維持競爭力的關鍵。","comment_en":"Everpure demonstrates strong operational efficiency, reflected in its consistent revenue growth and profitability. The company effectively manages production, supply chains, and sales channels to meet market demand. Its solid ROE and ROA metrics indirectly support this efficiency. Continuous process optimization and cost control are key to maintaining its competitive edge."},"m8_capital_allocation":{"score":8,"comment_zh":"Everpure 的財務狀況穩健，現金儲備充足，負債水平低，顯示出良好的資本配置能力。公司能夠通過有機增長、潛在的戰略收購以及對股東的回報來有效地運用資本。穩定的自由現金流（FCF）也為其提供了靈活性。管理層在資本配置上的審慎態度有助於長期價值創造。","comment_en":"Everpure's sound financial position, with ample cash reserves and low debt, indicates strong capital allocation capabilities. The company effectively deploys capital through organic growth, potential strategic acquisitions, and shareholder returns. Stable free cash flow (FCF) provides further flexibility. Management's prudent approach to capital allocation supports long-term value creation."},"m9_customer_retention":{"score":7,"comment_zh":"Everpure 在其目標市場，特別是企業客戶中，展現了較高的客戶留存率。這得益於其產品的可靠性、優質的客戶服務以及與客戶建立的長期合作關係。一旦客戶習慣了 Everpure 系統的性能和維護，更換的意願就會降低。持續的客戶滿意度是維持高留存率的關鍵。","comment_en":"Everpure exhibits a high customer retention rate within its target markets, especially among enterprise clients. This is attributed to product reliability, quality customer service, and established long-term relationships. Once customers are accustomed to the performance and maintenance of Everpure systems, their willingness to switch diminishes. Sustained customer satisfaction is key to maintaining high retention."},"m10_durability":{"score":7,"comment_zh":"水過濾行業具有一定的週期性，但對清潔和安全飲用水的需求是持久的。Everpure 的產品在醫療、食品服務和家庭等領域扮演著重要角色，這些領域的需求相對穩定。儘管面臨技術變革和新進入者的挑戰，但其品牌聲譽和核心技術為其提供了較強的長期韌性。","comment_en":"While the water filtration industry can have cyclical elements, the demand for clean and safe drinking water is enduring. Everpure's products play a crucial role in sectors like healthcare, food service, and residential use, where demand is relatively stable. Despite challenges from technological shifts and new entrants, its brand reputation and core technologies provide considerable long-term resilience."},"overall_moat_verdict_zh":"Everpure 的護城河主要體現在其強大的品牌定價權（M1）、穩健的營運效率（M7）、良好的資本配置能力（M8）以及較高的客戶留存率（M9）。其專利技術（M2）和規模經濟（M5）也提供了一定支持。然而，網絡效應（M4）和地理資產（M6）幾乎不存在。整體而言，Everpure 擁有一個類似『特許經營』的護城河，尤其是在高端餐飲和醫療市場，其品牌和可靠性使其能夠收取溢價，並維持穩定的客戶關係。其護城河雖非無懈可擊，但在其專注的領域內具有相當的持久性。","overall_moat_verdict_en":"Everpure's moat is primarily built on its strong brand pricing power (M1), robust operational efficiency (M7), sound capital allocation (M8), and high customer retention (M9). Patented technology (M2) and economies of scale (M5) offer additional support. However, network effects (M4) and geographic assets (M6) are largely absent. Overall, Everpure possesses a 'franchise-like' moat, particularly in premium food service and healthcare markets, where its brand and reliability allow it to command a premium and maintain stable customer relationships. While not impenetrable, its moat demonstrates considerable durability within its focused segments.","evidenceHash":"7f2876c528cbe34b425fb118c5279fe4be17df01902350cd4519835cadb0d817","assessmentPolicy":"us-buffett-moat-v3"},"ratingSources":{"moat":{"reason":null},"fScore":{"score":5,"checkedAt":null}},"fin_valuation":{"is_financial":false},"image":"https://images.financialmodelingprep.com/symbol/P.png","logo":"https://images.financialmodelingprep.com/symbol/P.png","website":"https://www.everpuredata.com","ceo":"Charles H. Giancarlo","full_time_employees":"6400","description":"Everpure, Inc. offers cutting-edge data storage solutions and services, empowering clients to extract maximum value from their information. The firm is committed to revolutionizing data storage and management, aiming to simplify how individuals access and engage with data. John M. Hayes and John Colgrove founded the company in October 2009, which is headquartered in Santa Clara, CA.","description_en":"Everpure, Inc. offers cutting-edge data storage solutions and services, empowering clients to extract maximum value from their information. The firm is committed to revolutionizing data storage and management, aiming to simplify how individuals access and engage with data. John M. Hayes and John Colgrove founded the company in October 2009, which is headquartered in Santa Clara, CA.","description_zh":"**Everpure, Inc. (P) 業務營運概述**\n\nEverpure, Inc. 專注於提供尖端數據儲存解決方案與服務，協助客戶最大化其資訊資產的價值。公司致力於革新數據儲存與管理方式，目標是簡化個人獲取與應用數據的流程。\n\n其核心業務涵蓋：\n\n*   **數據儲存解決方案：** 提供高效能、高可靠性的數據儲存硬體與軟體產品，滿足企業及個人在不同規模下的儲存需求。\n*   **數據管理服務：** 包含數據的整合、分析、安全保護及生命週期管理等，確保數據的可用性、完整性與合規性。\n*   **關鍵技術：** 運用先進的數據壓縮、加密、冗餘備份及雲端整合技術，提升數據儲存效率與安全性。\n*   **營運模式：** 以軟硬體整合銷售與訂閱式服務並行，透過專業技術支援與客戶成功團隊，建立長期合作夥伴關係。\n\nEverpure 透過創新技術與客製化服務，旨在成為數據儲存與管理領域的領導者。","address":"2555 Augustine Drive","city":"Santa Clara","state":"CA","zip":"95054","country":"US","phone":"800 379 7873","full_address":"2555 Augustine Drive, Santa Clara, CA 95054, US","range_52w":"56.78-157.57","year_high":157.57,"year_low":56.78,"all_time_high":0,"all_time_low":56.78,"inst_ownership_pct":null,"insider_ownership_pct":null,"top_holders":[],"insider_trades":[{"date":"2026-10-16","name":"Colgrove John","title":"director, officer: Chief Visionary Officer","is_buy":null,"action":"G-Gift","shares":100000,"price":0,"total_val":0},{"date":"2026-10-16","name":"Colgrove John","title":"director, officer: Chief Visionary Officer","is_buy":null,"action":"G-Gift","shares":100000,"price":0,"total_val":0},{"date":"2026-10-16","name":"Colgrove John","title":"director, officer: Chief Visionary Officer","is_buy":false,"action":"S-Sale","shares":21965,"price":141.31,"total_val":3.1},{"date":"2026-10-16","name":"Colgrove John","title":"director, officer: Chief Visionary Officer","is_buy":false,"action":"S-Sale","shares":17600,"price":142.28,"total_val":2.5},{"date":"2026-10-16","name":"Colgrove John","title":"director, officer: Chief Visionary Officer","is_buy":false,"action":"S-Sale","shares":5000,"price":143.21,"total_val":0.72},{"date":"2026-10-16","name":"Colgrove John","title":"director, officer: Chief Visionary Officer","is_buy":false,"action":"S-Sale","shares":7694,"price":144.24,"total_val":1.11},{"date":"2026-10-16","name":"Colgrove John","title":"director, officer: Chief Visionary Officer","is_buy":false,"action":"S-Sale","shares":8003,"price":145.26,"total_val":1.16},{"date":"2026-10-16","name":"Colgrove John","title":"director, officer: Chief Visionary Officer","is_buy":false,"action":"S-Sale","shares":4601,"price":146.15,"total_val":0.67},{"date":"2026-10-16","name":"Colgrove John","title":"director, officer: Chief Visionary Officer","is_buy":false,"action":"S-Sale","shares":6942,"price":147.29,"total_val":1.02},{"date":"2026-10-16","name":"Colgrove John","title":"director, officer: Chief Visionary Officer","is_buy":false,"action":"S-Sale","shares":11558,"price":148.25,"total_val":1.71}],"stock_splits":[],"fmp_symbol":"P","real_5y_prices":[],"historical_dcf_series":[],"name_en":"Everpure, Inc.","expansion":{"status":"available","capturedAt":"2026-10-22T13:21:32.229Z","reason":null,"detailPath":"cache/us_companies/P.json"}},"snapshot":null,"model":null}
